# With completed hidden, a done INBOX is not the inbox: qi adds to the first INBOX still shown, and likewise qt.
file <<END
INBOX: @done(2026-10-01)
	- Old
TODAY: @done(2026-10-01)
INBOX:
	- Live
TODAY:
END
keys gc
hide @done
keys qi
see Quick Add → INBOX
type To the shown inbox
keys <Enter> qt
see Quick Add → TODAY
type Water plants
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @done(2026-10-01)
	- Old
TODAY: @done(2026-10-01)
INBOX:
	- Live
	- To the shown inbox
TODAY:
	- Water plants
END
